{"id":"14d1529c46c2f8f2","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-parallel-repetition.md","title":"二部约束博弈的并行重复","display":"df-parallel-repetition — 二部约束博弈的并行重复","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-parallel-repetition","aliases":["28-df-parallel-repetition"],"display":"df-parallel-repetition — 二部约束博弈的并行重复","depends_on":["[[28-df-projection-game]]"],"source_book_location":"§22.3.1","source_printed_pages":"473–474","source_pdf_pages":"499–500","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-parallel-repetition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-parallel-repetition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-parallel-repetition — 二部约束博弈的并行重复"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c701516ccadd54fe\" href=\"?note=c701516ccadd54fe\" title=\"28-df-projection-game\">28-df-projection-game</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§22.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"473–474"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"499–500"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)\">\\(\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c701516ccadd54fe\" href=\"?note=c701516ccadd54fe\" title=\"28-df-projection-game\">28-df-projection-game</a> 的有限二部约束数据，不要求投影性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，原约束统一为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。重复的左右整数标签字母表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[W^k]\">\\([W^k]\\)</span>，通过下式双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_k:[W]^k\\to[W^k]\">\\(\\beta_k:[W]^k\\to[W^k]\\)</span> 编码元组标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}_k\\)</span> 为其逆；新顶点集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^k,V^k\">\\(U^k,V^k\\)</span>，边集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^k\">\\(E^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec e\\in E^k\">\\(\\vec e\\in E^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u,\\vec v\\in[W]^k\">\\(\\vec u,\\vec v\\in[W]^k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in[W^k]\">\\(a,b\\in[W^k]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{bi}\">\\(\\mathrm{bi}\\)</span> 标识本项的二部赋值值函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta_k(\\vec u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^k(u_i-1)W^{k-i},\\qquad \\operatorname{dec}_k(a)\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec u\\in[W]^k\\;(\\beta_k(\\vec u)=a)\\quad(a\\in[W^k]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta_k(\\vec u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^k(u_i-1)W^{k-i},\\qquad \\operatorname{dec}_k(a)\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec u\\in[W]^k\\;(\\beta_k(\\vec u)=a)\\quad(a\\in[W^k]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(s(e_1),\\ldots,s(e_k)),\\qquad t^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(t(e_1),\\ldots,t(e_k)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(s(e_1),\\ldots,s(e_k)),\\qquad t^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(t(e_1),\\ldots,t(e_k)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P^{*k}_{\\vec e}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^kP_{e_i}(\\operatorname{dec}_k(a)_i,\\operatorname{dec}_k(b)_i),\\qquad\\Phi^{*k}\\coloneqq(U^k,V^k,E^k,s^{*k},t^{*k},(P^{*k}_{\\vec e})_{\\vec e\\in E^k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P^{*k}_{\\vec e}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^kP_{e_i}(\\operatorname{dec}_k(a)_i,\\operatorname{dec}_k(b)_i),\\qquad\\Phi^{*k}\\coloneqq(U^k,V^k,E^k,s^{*k},t^{*k},(P^{*k}_{\\vec e})_{\\vec e\\in E^k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\ge\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\ge\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新赋值可以依赖整个顶点元组；不能假设它逐坐标独立，所以一般不能把值写成精确 k 次方。下界来自对原最优赋值逐坐标取积。原书用 2CSP 元组描述重复，此处固定二部版本以避免非二部共享变量约束的歧义；元组字母表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[W]^k\">\\([W]^k\\)</span> 由前两节的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_k\">\\(\\beta_k\\)</span> 正式编号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[W^k]\">\\([W^k]\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§22.3.1；印刷页 473–474；PDF 页 499–500。</p>\n<p>R7：把元组标签到整数标签的转换移入正式构造，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi^{*k}\">\\(\\Phi^{*k}\\)</span> 符合上游二部博弈的整数标签签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}\">\\(\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}\\)</span> 可直接应用。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ge2\">\\(W\\ge2\\)</span> 时这是基 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> 展开，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W=1\">\\(W=1\\)</span> 时两边均为单元素集，所以逆解码在所有允许参数下存在且唯一。赋值经该双射对应，原值下界保持不变；本次只复核构造和此下界，不核验 Raz 深证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-projection-game","status":"resolved","id":"c701516ccadd54fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-projection-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-projection-game","status":"resolved","id":"c701516ccadd54fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)$ 为 [[28-df-projection-game]] 的有限二部约束数据，不要求投影性；$W,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，原约束统一为 $P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$。重复的左右整数标签字母表为 $[W^k]$，通过下式双射 $\\beta_k:[W]^k\\to[W^k]$ 编码元组标签，$\\operatorname{dec}_k$ 为其逆；新顶点集合 $U^k,V^k$，边集合 $E^k$。$\\vec e\\in E^k$，$\\vec u,\\vec v\\in[W]^k$，$a,b\\in[W^k]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,(P_e)_e)","display":false},{"tex":"W,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"P_e:[W]^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[W^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_k:[W]^k\\to[W^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"U^k,V^k","display":false},{"tex":"E^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec e\\in E^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u,\\vec v\\in[W]^k","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in[W^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{bi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_k(\\vec u)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^k(u_i-1)W^{k-i},\\qquad \\operatorname{dec}_k(a)\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec u\\in[W]^k\\;(\\beta_k(\\vec u)=a)\\quad(a\\in[W^k]).","display":true},{"tex":"s^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(s(e_1),\\ldots,s(e_k)),\\qquad t^{*k}(\\vec e)\\coloneqq(t(e_1),\\ldots,t(e_k)).","display":true},{"tex":"P^{*k}_{\\vec e}(a,b)\\coloneqq\\prod_{i=1}^kP_{e_i}(\\operatorname{dec}_k(a)_i,\\operatorname{dec}_k(b)_i),\\qquad\\Phi^{*k}\\coloneqq(U^k,V^k,E^k,s^{*k},t^{*k},(P^{*k}_{\\vec e})_{\\vec e\\in E^k}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi^{*k})\\ge\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}(\\Phi)^k.","display":true},{"tex":"[W]^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_k","display":false},{"tex":"[W^k]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi^{*k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\ge2","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"W=1","display":false}],"bytes":2610,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-400","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"},{"id":"bcd7bbad4b927831","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge2}$，$[W]=\\{1,\\ldots,W\\}$。$\\operatorname{BiGame}_W$ 是下式定义的合法二部博弈谓词；$\\Phi=(U,V,E,s,t,P)$ 中 $P=(P_e)_{e\\in E}$ 是边约束族，左右顶点按所属侧区分。$U,V,E$ 为集合，$s,t,P$ 为函数候选。\n$\\Phi^{*k}$、$\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathrm{bi}}$ 采用 [[28-df-parallel-repetition]] 及其上游的有限二部博弈接口，仅在 $\\operatorname{BiGame}_W(\\Phi)$ 成立时使用；边均匀抽样。对 $k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，重复博弈的整数标签字母表为 $[W^k]$，编解码使用上游的 $\\beta_k,\\operatorname{dec}_k$；$\\nu\\in(0,1)$。"}],"outgoing":["c701516ccadd54fe"]}